  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">注意：本模组1.0.0及以上版本为Create 6.0兼容版本，且无其他官方分支</span></p><p>本模组在1.20.1版本中也被称为CBC More Shells</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1222164/description_86ee6eb4-e745-46c5-b6b5-adb0b2d9dacb.jpg\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1222164/description_b0b2cddf-a172-4c69-a4ed-712753cf151d.png\"></p><p>本扩展模组包含：</p><ul>\n<li>新型火炮装置鱼雷发射管</li>\n<li>多种动能鱼雷</li>\n<li>具备多种材质属性与战斗指挥机制的双管火炮</li>\n<li>可装载炸弹、鱼雷、火箭等弹种的弹射架</li>\n<li>新型大口径炮弹</li>\n</ul><p>以及更多内容……</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">推荐搭配整合包游玩：<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-adventure-of-valkyriens-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">瓦尔基里冒险2</a></span></strong></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/AB2wYbcrFf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord频道</a></strong></span></h2><p>此为@ItsRuby05为本模组制作的一款材质包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cbc-more-shells-refreshed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cbc-more-shells-refreshed</a></p>",
